273	    /**
274	     * The owner's membership level: a number from 1 to 3 assigned at creation. Starts
275	     * at 1, gains 1 when an email address is present, gains a further 1 when the owner
276	     * has no namesakes ({@code namesakeCount} is 0), and is capped at 3 (level 4 is
277	     * reserved for tenure). Derived from the owner's own fields.
278	     */
